sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Skill as Robot Python Skill Client
    participant IAM as AWS IAM Service
    participant Gateway as Bedrock AgentCore Secure Gateway
    participant Lambda as RobotToolFunction (Lambda)
    participant IoT as AWS IoT Core

    Note over Skill, Gateway: Skill uses SkillMcpUser AccessKey/SecretKey <br> to sign the payload with SigV4
    Skill->>Gateway: POST /gateway (InvokeGateway with 'robot_wave')
    Gateway->>IAM: Verify Signature & Evaluate IAM Policies
    
    alt Verification Failed (Tampered or Missing Permission)
        IAM-->>Gateway: Access Denied
        Gateway-->>Skill: 403 Forbidden
    else Verification Successful
        IAM-->>Gateway: Signature Valid
        Gateway->>Lambda: Route execution to robot_tool_lambda.py
        Lambda->>IoT: Publish execution parameters to robot_1/topic
        IoT-->>Lambda: Message Ack
        Lambda-->>Gateway: Return Success JSON payload
        Gateway-->>Skill: Return 200 OK
    end
